<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #2A2A2A">Growing up in Dubai, my after-school schedule was always full: public speaking, dance, abacus and art classes.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #2A2A2A">Each one stuck with me in its own way. Abacus made me comfortable with numbers early on. Public speaking taught me to explain ideas clearly to any audience. Art and dance gave me an eye for design and the patience to keep practicing until something works.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #2A2A2A">I still use all of that today, whether I'm presenting findings to a team or building a dashboard that has to be both accurate and easy to read.</p>
